    "recordSemantics": "All repeated PID+code geometries have zero positive-area overlap; some touch at boundaries. This supports disjoint components but does not establish that the publisher intends them as one property footprint. The exact parcelcode 2KB009 lookup also returns a different PID, so parcelcode is not unique.",
    "publisherLabelEvidence": "Viewer UI labels parcelid as PID and parcelcode as Code/Address Code. Treat parcelid as the publisher app PID, not an authoritative statutory cadastral identifier. The repeated PID+code geometries are disjoint by area (two pairs touch at boundaries), but this does not prove the app intends them as component footprints of one property."
