    "basis": "The app exposes PID as its native record identity. Complete disjoint geometry for all rows of that PID is retained with matching parcelcode. The adapter promises publisher app-PID footprints, not statutory cadastral lots; official authority and legal meaning remain unconfirmed and are disclosed. All four repeated PID groups and two independent complete snapshots passed. Earlier worker caution is retained as evidence, superseded for this explicitly narrower app-identity scope."
